  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 304.10 Waivers. Any supplier of water who would be adversely impacted by the strict application of a rule in this part and who wishes to request a waiver of the rule shall do so in accordance with Env-Dw 202.\n\nSource. #9577, eff 10-23-09; ss by #12444, eff 1-1-18",
